WEBVTT

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:08.772
After sneaking into a cargo vessel,
Candy and Cookie are heading to America.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:11.877
They've been found by the sailors.

00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:15.774
Captain Nieven told them that...

00:00:15.924 --> 00:00:23.449
they'll be sent back to England
next morning.

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:31.260
On the other shore of the stormy sea.

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:45.006
It's almost dawn.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:48.339
Once the ship appears over the horizon,

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:51.948
I will be sent back to England.

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:56.948
Sorry, Kurin.

00:00:57.098 --> 00:01:00.857
I thought that
we can return to home peacefully.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:05.660
- Candy!
- What's matter, Cookie?

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.861
The ship has arrived.

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.635
I see nothing.

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:17.035
I can see that.

00:01:17.185 --> 00:01:20.375
Nothing can escape
from the sailor's eyes.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.274
It's true.

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:27.946
The ship's coming, Cookie.

00:01:28.096 --> 00:01:31.752
We still have 30 minutes, wait here.

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:35.320
Where are you going, Cookie?

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:40.393
No way! What do you want?

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:42.134
Please!

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:47.432
I would like to return to England,
let Candy go to America.

00:01:47.582 --> 00:01:48.940
No way!

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:51.810
Candy must return to America.

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:53.670
Captain!

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:03.615
Boat ready!

00:02:03.765 --> 00:02:05.157
Captain.

00:02:14.834 --> 00:02:18.235
Good! Wait for the captain's signal.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:25.675
Wait, Captain!

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:32.444
Let Candy return to America.

00:02:32.594 --> 00:02:33.713
No way!

00:02:34.754 --> 00:02:35.721
Wait!

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:39.117
How many times you want me to say?

00:02:39.267 --> 00:02:42.053
Heartless Octopuses!

00:02:42.203 --> 00:02:44.022
The captain is a fool!

00:02:44.172 --> 00:02:45.757
Stop that, Cookie!

00:02:45.907 --> 00:02:47.125
But...

00:02:47.275 --> 00:02:49.168
- Viva.
- Yes

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:52.699
Grasp this boy.

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:54.863
It's Captain's order.

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:59.907
Sorry, Cookie. It's Captain's order.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:03.041
What are you doing? Release me!

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:08.344
Let him have a good spanking!

00:03:08.494 --> 00:03:09.648
Stop!

00:03:16.396 --> 00:03:18.455
For misbehaving in front of the captain.

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:27.865
Send them to that ship!

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:32.071
Candy! Your baggage.

00:03:33.146 --> 00:03:34.239
Thanks.

00:03:34.389 --> 00:03:35.804
Let's go!

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:38.644
Take care of yourself.

00:03:40.286 --> 00:03:43.515
Damn it! He spanked me like a kid!

00:03:43.665 --> 00:03:47.918
Everyone! Sorry to bother you!

00:03:48.068 --> 00:03:49.053
Take care!

00:03:49.203 --> 00:03:51.790
Take the passenger ship next time.

00:03:51.965 --> 00:03:54.957
Captain Nieven, good bye!

00:03:58.004 --> 00:04:01.132
You don't have to say good bye
to this kind of man.

00:04:01.282 --> 00:04:03.437
Was your punishment not enough?

00:04:04.344 --> 00:04:07.372
I will definitely be back again.

00:04:07.522 --> 00:04:10.644
I will hide carefully
and go to America.

00:04:11.618 --> 00:04:14.519
Shut your mouth up and get on the boat!

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:21.750
Come, Candy.

00:04:27.567 --> 00:04:29.091
Watch your step.

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:41.508
Captain Nieven! An urgent telegram!

00:04:42.548 --> 00:04:44.243
An urgent telegram?

00:04:54.527 --> 00:04:57.257
Sorry we don't have umbrella, Kurin.

00:04:59.532 --> 00:05:00.858
Don't blame us!

00:05:01.008 --> 00:05:02.760
I wish I was in charge.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:05.133
Unfortunately,
It's captain to take charge of.

00:05:06.339 --> 00:05:09.206
Stop talking like that, row quickly!

00:05:09.542 --> 00:05:11.435
Brother!

00:05:11.585 --> 00:05:15.506
I have a friend on that ship.

00:05:15.656 --> 00:05:18.345
You can ask him for help!

00:05:18.885 --> 00:05:20.682
Thank you!

00:05:28.795 --> 00:05:30.023
Now what?

00:05:30.496 --> 00:05:32.487
Bro! The ship...

00:05:42.942 --> 00:05:44.773
What's the matter?

00:05:45.211 --> 00:05:46.940
The Sea Gull...

00:05:50.016 --> 00:05:51.813
- Brother!
- Cookie!

00:05:51.984 --> 00:05:54.646
You can read the flag signal?

00:05:54.796 --> 00:05:56.746
Mission stop!

00:05:57.056 --> 00:05:59.149
All men return on board!

00:05:59.792 --> 00:06:01.987
Return on board?

00:06:08.668 --> 00:06:10.329
What's the matter?

00:06:10.603 --> 00:06:13.464
I feel a little dizzy.

00:06:13.614 --> 00:06:17.339
You bastard! Dizzy?

00:06:18.111 --> 00:06:19.601
Mr. Viva.

00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:21.339
Let me help you!

00:06:21.489 --> 00:06:23.348
Sorry! Please!

00:06:45.605 --> 00:06:47.368
Captain Nieven.

00:06:48.541 --> 00:06:50.134
Thank you!

00:06:50.284 --> 00:06:53.504
I was wrong about you!

00:06:53.654 --> 00:06:54.739
Don't misunderstand.

00:06:54.889 --> 00:06:58.477
It's because of violent storm alert.

00:06:58.651 --> 00:07:00.516
A storm?

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:05.147
Just a small storm.

00:07:05.658 --> 00:07:09.492
Even you're stowaways,
I still have to save your lives.

00:07:12.231 --> 00:07:14.529
The storm is coming.

00:07:15.168 --> 00:07:17.432
All engines!

00:07:32.218 --> 00:07:35.244
Can I help you?

00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:38.789
It's dangerous here.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.054
Where are the others?

00:07:43.204 --> 00:07:44.892
Where is Viva?

00:07:45.731 --> 00:07:47.323
I'll go find him.

00:07:52.071 --> 00:07:54.369
Are you okay, Mr. Viva?

00:07:55.107 --> 00:07:56.367
Candy!

00:07:56.517 --> 00:07:59.570
When you were in the cabin,
did you hear a rat?

00:07:59.979 --> 00:08:01.139
No.

00:08:01.314 --> 00:08:04.215
The footsteps of rats?

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:05.810
No.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:10.815
Think well!
It's a matter of life and death!

00:08:10.965 --> 00:08:14.518
I really didn't hear anything.

00:08:14.827 --> 00:08:16.385
Is that true?

00:08:19.899 --> 00:08:21.799
It's over!

00:08:22.168 --> 00:08:23.995
What do you mean?

00:08:24.145 --> 00:08:29.474
Rats leave first the sinking ship.

00:08:31.611 --> 00:08:33.044
Disgusting...

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:36.842
The ship is sinking? How could she?

00:08:43.422 --> 00:08:47.685
Cookie, is Mr. Viva telling the truth?

00:08:47.835 --> 00:08:51.122
Rats have the instinct of foreknowledge.

00:08:51.272 --> 00:08:54.625
There are no rats on a sinking ship.

00:08:54.775 --> 00:08:55.997
I see.

00:08:58.804 --> 00:09:00.362
I'll help them.

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:02.335
I'm going too.

00:09:13.786 --> 00:09:15.446
Move fast!

00:09:15.596 --> 00:09:17.853
The falling crates
might be dangerous.

00:09:34.674 --> 00:09:36.733
Watch out!

00:09:37.443 --> 00:09:38.469
I came to help!

00:09:38.619 --> 00:09:42.306
Go back to your cabin,
children should not be playing around here!

00:09:42.456 --> 00:09:45.475
I'm not a child! Watch!

00:10:11.577 --> 00:10:13.067
Danger! Cookie!

00:10:16.048 --> 00:10:17.310
Cookie!

00:10:24.357 --> 00:10:25.881
Cookie!

00:10:43.609 --> 00:10:45.063
Is he all right?

00:10:45.213 --> 00:10:48.943
His life is in no danger,
it's only a bone fracture.

00:10:49.215 --> 00:10:54.278
If he has hurt the nerve,
he might get paralyzed forever.

00:10:56.255 --> 00:10:57.448
Captain, please.

00:10:57.598 --> 00:10:58.583
What's matter?

00:10:58.733 --> 00:11:00.751
The water is soaking in.

00:11:00.901 --> 00:11:02.157
What?

00:11:05.031 --> 00:11:07.625
I have to help Cookie.

00:11:10.269 --> 00:11:13.631
When I was a child, at Pony's...

00:11:13.781 --> 00:11:15.731
That's it!

00:11:18.644 --> 00:11:20.441
Thank you, Kurin.

00:11:33.859 --> 00:11:35.620
It hurts, Cookie?

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:37.989
Cookie, do you know who I am?

00:11:38.139 --> 00:11:40.123
I am Candy, do you recognize me?

00:11:45.304 --> 00:11:46.731
Don't move!

00:11:46.881 --> 00:11:49.138
Your foot is broken.

00:11:49.608 --> 00:11:50.734
Go away!

00:11:52.278 --> 00:11:54.075
Cookie.

00:12:01.887 --> 00:12:03.354
Damn it!

00:12:10.996 --> 00:12:13.157
It hurts, Cookie?

00:12:13.307 --> 00:12:15.427
I don't care about the pain.

00:12:16.235 --> 00:12:19.230
My leg... my leg is broken.

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:23.532
How can I become a sailor?

00:12:23.682 --> 00:12:30.074
Cookie, when I was a child,
I saw someone break his leg...

00:12:30.224 --> 00:12:32.811
That will mend soon.

00:12:33.853 --> 00:12:36.515
He didn't damage the leg's nerve!

00:12:36.956 --> 00:12:38.916
We don't know if your nerve is hurt.

00:12:39.066 --> 00:12:42.757
Damn it! Sink this ship!

00:12:47.967 --> 00:12:50.027
Why you say so, Cookie?

00:12:50.177 --> 00:12:51.162
Get out!

00:12:51.312 --> 00:12:52.730
You have to calm down, Cookie.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:56.070
It's not sure whether
your nerve was hurt.

00:12:56.842 --> 00:13:00.141
Is that so?
I've lost my leg already!

00:13:03.115 --> 00:13:06.610
Candy! Someone got hurt, come quick!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.175
Okay!

00:13:09.421 --> 00:13:11.412
Seasick again?

00:13:21.133 --> 00:13:23.027
It hurts!

00:13:23.177 --> 00:13:26.503
I'll bandage you, stand still.

00:13:27.439 --> 00:13:28.736
Thank you, Candy.

00:13:28.974 --> 00:13:30.271
It's nothing.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:34.311
You are doing well,
you must be a good nurse.

00:13:38.651 --> 00:13:40.551
Okay, back to work!

00:13:51.163 --> 00:13:53.393
The water has come in.

00:13:58.437 --> 00:14:02.669
Donâ€™t just stand there!
Move or we will have trouble.

00:14:33.873 --> 00:14:36.899
Kurin, you're here!

00:14:39.245 --> 00:14:40.504
Mr. Viva.

00:14:40.654 --> 00:14:43.641
Candy, the storm is finally over.

00:14:43.791 --> 00:14:45.176
Are you still seasick?

00:14:45.326 --> 00:14:47.242
I'm exhausted.

00:14:49.955 --> 00:14:53.784
That's right,
everybody was busy over the night.

00:14:53.934 --> 00:14:55.087
Okay!

00:15:03.836 --> 00:15:05.796
This is my unique cooking.

00:15:05.946 --> 00:15:07.097
Candy!

00:15:07.247 --> 00:15:10.201
Sorry, I didn't ask your permission!

00:15:10.351 --> 00:15:11.869
Never mind.

00:15:12.019 --> 00:15:14.139
Will you taste it for me?

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:24.548
How can they eat this kind of things?

00:15:24.698 --> 00:15:26.557
So awful?

00:15:27.693 --> 00:15:29.053
Just the opposite.

00:15:29.203 --> 00:15:33.030
Both I and the Captain have never
tasted something so delicious before!

00:15:35.034 --> 00:15:38.128
Whom you learn cooking from?

00:15:38.304 --> 00:15:39.965
It's Sister Pony.

00:15:40.606 --> 00:15:42.403
Sister Pony?

00:15:42.741 --> 00:15:46.233
She brought me up,
just like my mother.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:51.508
If one makes this kind of soup,
it must be a very gentle person.

00:15:51.658 --> 00:15:53.175
The soup?

00:15:53.752 --> 00:15:57.313
You can tell someone's character
from what he makes.

00:15:58.290 --> 00:16:00.349
It smells so good! What is it?

00:16:02.695 --> 00:16:05.664
They already smelled it.

00:16:06.598 --> 00:16:09.499
Here! Candy's special!

00:16:10.436 --> 00:16:12.301
That's great!

00:16:23.549 --> 00:16:25.223
One more!

00:16:25.373 --> 00:16:29.046
Viva, how about the seasickness?

00:16:29.196 --> 00:16:31.612
I'm okay now!

00:16:33.859 --> 00:16:37.852
Cookie needs a bowl of soup.

00:16:45.037 --> 00:16:46.130
Cookie!

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:50.005
He's not here. Where is he?

00:16:54.713 --> 00:16:57.409
The harmonica that Terry gave him.

00:16:58.917 --> 00:17:00.179
Cookie!

00:17:06.892 --> 00:17:08.553
Cookie!

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:12.523
Cookie!

00:17:12.673 --> 00:17:14.429
Kurin, go tell everyone.

00:17:16.101 --> 00:17:17.161
Cookie, you idiot!

00:17:17.311 --> 00:17:18.228
Release me!

00:17:18.378 --> 00:17:20.497
If I can't be a sailor, I would rather die.

00:17:20.647 --> 00:17:23.370
Nobody said you can't be a sailor!

00:17:23.709 --> 00:17:26.405
I already know I can't be a sailor.

00:17:26.812 --> 00:17:30.741
Cookie, how can you be so weak?

00:17:30.891 --> 00:17:32.943
You can't understand my feelings.

00:17:33.285 --> 00:17:36.547
You don't understand the pain
of not being able to be a sailor.

00:17:36.697 --> 00:17:38.249
Somebody!

00:17:42.127 --> 00:17:43.424
Captain.

00:17:45.697 --> 00:17:46.925
Coward.

00:17:50.302 --> 00:17:52.196
Captain.

00:17:52.346 --> 00:17:55.132
Cookie,
you are not worthy to be a sailor.

00:17:55.282 --> 00:17:57.534
Yes, my body is already disabled.

00:17:57.684 --> 00:17:59.975
It's because of your cowardice.

00:18:00.212 --> 00:18:05.047
The man who shrinks back of trouble
can't be a sailor.

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:12.880
There's no place to hide on a boat.

00:18:13.459 --> 00:18:16.920
I didn't hide away from the storm.

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:20.969
In the voyage of life,
there are wind and waves at any time.

00:18:21.119 --> 00:18:23.690
You had the setback and want to die.
How many lives do you have?

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:25.162
Right, Cookie?

00:18:25.312 --> 00:18:29.566
Captain Nieven has contacted America
by radio.

00:18:29.716 --> 00:18:32.337
You can go to a hospital in America.

00:18:35.514 --> 00:18:36.947
Captain...

00:18:39.084 --> 00:18:40.878
Cookie, do your best!

00:18:41.028 --> 00:18:43.680
Make your dream come true.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:45.313
Candy!

00:18:49.128 --> 00:18:51.455
We will help you, Cookie.

00:18:51.605 --> 00:18:52.997
Yes, we will.

00:18:54.867 --> 00:18:57.427
Come, Cookie, you need sleep.

00:19:02.374 --> 00:19:04.171
Cheer up, Cookie!

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:06.570
Captain.

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:09.409
What happened to the ship
that was going back to England?

00:19:10.749 --> 00:19:13.582
I was told that she's okay.

00:19:14.186 --> 00:19:15.915
That's great!

00:19:25.531 --> 00:19:28.364
Cookie wants to be a sailor.

00:19:28.634 --> 00:19:31.728
Terrius wants to be an actor.

00:19:31.937 --> 00:19:36.033
I want to try my own ability...

00:19:36.183 --> 00:19:38.872
to return to America.

00:19:39.244 --> 00:19:41.678
I can't be defeated by
Terrius and Cookie.

00:19:47.819 --> 00:19:48.979
What happened?

00:19:49.129 --> 00:19:51.887
Candy, the port!

00:20:02.434 --> 00:20:05.426
America! My homeland!

00:20:05.971 --> 00:20:09.668
Cookie!

00:20:10.509 --> 00:20:13.171
We have already arrived in America!

00:20:13.445 --> 00:20:14.571
Really?

00:20:14.721 --> 00:20:16.707
Mr. Viva, please take care of Cookie.

00:20:16.857 --> 00:20:18.511
- Okay!
- Thank you!

00:20:47.246 --> 00:20:48.705
Finally...

00:20:48.855 --> 00:20:51.305
Finally arrived.

00:20:51.583 --> 00:20:56.282
Sister Pony, sister Lane, Terrius...

00:20:56.755 --> 00:21:00.020
The people I love.

00:21:00.492 --> 00:21:04.053
You are all in front of me.

00:21:11.336 --> 00:21:14.032
The endless voyage
has come to an end.

00:21:14.339 --> 00:21:16.364
America at this moment...

00:21:16.575 --> 00:21:21.512
opened her arms
to greet Candy's return.
